The '''Sultanate of Maros''' ([[w:Makassarese language|Marosan]]: ''Karaeng si Maros ( ᨀᨑᨕᨛᨂᨛ ᨔᨗ ᨆᨑᨚᨔᨛ)'') was a {{W|Thalassocracy}} centred on the city of [[Maros]], located on [[Northeast Fosia]] neck of [[Balausian Peninsula]] on the coast of [[Shendan Ocean]].
